<msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> The columns of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"50\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A6\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> can be written in any order.</p>\n</div></div>",
